  "description": "Firely Server (formerly: Vonk) supports building a Facade or a Plugin, see the product pages for Firely Server (https://fire.ly/products/firely-server and FHIR Facade (https://fire.ly/products/fhir-facade).\nVonk.Facade.Relational provides base classes to ease the implementation of a Facade on top of an existing relational database.\nYou need Firely Server to use Vonk.Facade.Relational. Go to the product page to download a copy, including an evaluation license.\nVisit the documentation pages (https://docs.fire.ly/firelyserver/index.html) for documentation and examples on how to build a Facade.",
